BAR Droid phone version of BAR's Awards (luaui/widgets/gui_awards.lua), the panel at a game's end: its Leave and Show
Graphs are words, pressed in a strip 5 under and 5 over them, about 27 high in all: upright on a phone about 1.5 mm for
a finger (dev phone, 2026-11-17, a skirmish ended upright). The press strips 22 under and over the words; its close X's
strip as much wider and taller, within the panel; the words and their places as BAR has them. Applied by the engine
(BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no place, BAR's own file runs.

@@@ find
			and (y > widgetY + mathFloor((50 - 5) * widgetScale))
			and (y < widgetY + mathFloor((50 + 17 + 5) * widgetScale))
		then
			if chobbyLoaded then
@@@ with
			-- BAR Droid (phone): a finger's strip, 22 under and over the words (BAR's 5: about 1.5 mm in all upright)
			and (y > widgetY + mathFloor((50 - 22) * widgetScale))
			and (y < widgetY + mathFloor((50 + 17 + 22) * widgetScale))
		then
			if chobbyLoaded then
@@@ end

@@@ find
			and (
				y > widgetY + mathFloor((50 - 5) * widgetScale)
				and (y < widgetY + mathFloor((50 + 17 + 5) * widgetScale))
			)
		then
			-- The team stats panel on its Graphs page, not the engine's end-game box:
@@@ with
			and (
				-- BAR Droid (phone): a finger's strip, as Leave's
				y > widgetY + mathFloor((50 - 22) * widgetScale)
				and (y < widgetY + mathFloor((50 + 17 + 22) * widgetScale))
			)
		then
			-- The team stats panel on its Graphs page, not the engine's end-game box:
@@@ end

@@@ find
			(x > widgetX + widgetWidthScaled - closeRightX - mathFloor(5 * widgetScale))
			and (x < widgetX + widgetWidthScaled - closeRightX + mathFloor(20 * widgetScale) * font:GetTextWidth("X") + mathFloor(
				5 * widgetScale
			))
			and (
				y > widgetY + widgetHeightScaled - mathFloor((10 + 17 + 5) * widgetScale)
				and (y < widgetY + widgetHeightScaled - mathFloor((10 - 5) * widgetScale))
			)
		then
			if WG.guishader then
@@@ with
			-- BAR Droid (phone): the X's strip 25 more to its left, to the panel's edge on its right, down to 52 under
			-- the top (BAR's about 22 by 27 round a 12 wide X)
			(x > widgetX + widgetWidthScaled - closeRightX - mathFloor(30 * widgetScale))
			and (x < widgetX + widgetWidthScaled)
			and (
				y > widgetY + widgetHeightScaled - mathFloor((10 + 17 + 25) * widgetScale)
				and (y < widgetY + widgetHeightScaled - mathFloor((10 - 5) * widgetScale))
			)
		then
			if WG.guishader then
@@@ end
